{'symbol': 'SNA', 'date': '2019-11-07 22:30:00', 'title': 'SNAP-ON INCORPORATED DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 10, 2019', 'text': "SNAP-ON INCORPORATED ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND OF $1.08 PER SHARE PAYABLE DECEMBER 10, 2019 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON NOVEMBER 20, 2019. THIS REPRESENTS AN INCREASE OF $0.13 PER SHARE, OR 13.7%, OVER THE COMPANY'S PREVIOUS QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.95 PER SHARE."}